Package: Rcudd
Title: R-Wrapper for the CUDD BDD Library
Version: 0.0.0.9999
Authors@R: c(
	person("Matthias", "Ollech", email = "ollech@gmx.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
	person("Regents of the University of Colorado", comment = "Copyright holder of included CUDD library", role = "cph")
  )
Description:
    Simplifies Boolean expressions and conditional chains using the CUDD
    binary decision diagram library. Converts quoted R expressions to and from
    Boolean formulas, with optional resource-bounded MaxSAT formula synthesis
    through 'Rwbo'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    Rwbo,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
